sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant React
    participant FastAPI
    participant Storage
    participant DB
    participant RabbitMQ
    
    User->>React: Select PDF & click Upload
    React->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/documents/upload (Multipart)
    
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Validate JWT & CSRF
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Validate Content-Type (pdf, png, jpg)
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Validate Magic Bytes
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Generate correlation_id
    
    FastAPI->>Storage: save_document(file_bytes, uuid)
    Storage-->>FastAPI: returns file_path
    
    FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO documents (status=UPLOADED)
    DB-->>FastAPI: document_id
    
    FastAPI->>DB: INSERT INTO processing_jobs (status=PENDING)
    DB-->>FastAPI: job_id
    
    FastAPI->>RabbitMQ: Celery Publish (process_document_task, job_id)
    
    FastAPI-->>React: 201 Created (document_id)
    React-->>User: Redirect to Processing View
